cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository in academic work, please cite the associated
  Cryptology ePrint Archive paper given in preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "SLH-DSA PRF Power Trace Capture (ChipWhisperer)"
authors:
  - name: "SLH-DSA PRF Capture contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/j-tw0/SLH-DSA-PRF-Capture"
url: "https://github.com/j-tw0/SLH-DSA-PRF-Capture"
abstract: >-
  Research software for ChipWhisperer acquisition of power traces from
  address-based SLH-DSA PRF operations. Includes random-address, message-driven signing-order, and
  key-generation WOTS_PRF sequence capture workflows and target firmware.
keywords:
  - SLH-DSA
  - side-channel analysis
  - power trace capture
  - ChipWhisperer
